          "name": "Submit URL for verification",
          "request": {
            "name": "Submit URL for verification",
            "description": {
              "content": "Submit a URL for verification. URLs are automatically checked against Google Web Risk API. Safe URLs are auto-approved, malicious URLs are blocked. URL shorteners (bit.ly, t.co, etc.) are always blocked.\n\n**Important:** All SMS and Email messages containing URLs require those URLs to be verified before the message can be sent. This endpoint allows pre-verification of URLs.",
